        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "The main field is woven with white linen and stripes of pinkish red cotton. These stripes are outlined and detailed with embroidery done with a different shade of red cotton.  Joined at one end by fagoting is a piece of white linen on which are worked with red cotton and black silk, symmetrical forms possibly derived from flowers and a piece of red cotton."@en ;
